our hips at the top","plain":"At the top the shoulders have turned about 39\u00b0 past the hips. That stretch is the one to keep \u2014 the downswing gets its speed from letting it unwind, hips first.","why":"The gap between shoulders and hips stretches the trunk at the top. Speed comes from letting that stretch unwind, hips first \u2014 not from throwing the arms.","cue":"Let the hips stop turning before the shoulders do. Keep the trail knee flexed so the hips stay quiet.","drill":"Pause at the top for a count of two, then start down with the lead hip, not the arms. Eight reps.","check":"Shoulders-past-hips at the top stays near 39\u00b0, with the hips quiet before the shoulders unwind.","metric":{"value":"39\u00b0","caption":"shoulders past hips at the top"},"start_time":0.72,"end_time":1.05,"severity":88,"focus":{"anchor":"neck","bones":["torso","neck"],"label":"Shoulders past hips"}},{"id":"lead-arm","title":"Lead arm bends","headline":"Your front arm collapses at the top","plain":"At the top of the backswing your front arm bends about 44\u00b0 (it was nearly straight at address). That shortens the swing arc, so the club has less room to build speed.","why":"A bent lead arm narrows the swing radius, so the clubhead has less time to build speed.","cue":"At the top, keep the front arm long \u2014 stretch it away from your head, not chicken-winged in.","drill":"Pump drill. Pause at the top with the lead arm extended, pump down halfway twice, then swing through. Eight reps.","check":"Lead elbow flex at the top stays under 30\u00b0 instead of 44\u00b0.","metric":{"value":"44\u00b0","caption":"front-arm bend at the top"},"start_time":0.8,"end_time":1.15,"severity":72,"focus":{"anchor":"ulna_l","bones":["humerus_l","ulna_l","radius_l"],"label":"Lead arm"}},{"id":"lead-arm-finish","title":"Lead arm stays bent","headline":"The front arm never fully recovers after impact","plain":"Through the finish the front arm is still bent around 65\u201370\u00b0. The arc that collapsed at the top never opens back up.","why":"If the lead arm stays collapsed after impact, you lose width through the ball and the club exits high and left of the target line.","cue":"After impact, feel the front arm extend toward the target \u2014 long and high into the finish.","drill":"Finish-hold. Hit half-swings and freeze for two counts with both arms long past the ball. Ten reps.","check":"Front-arm bend after impact drops below 40\u00b0 instead of holding near 70\u00b0.","metric":{"value":"70\u00b0","caption":"front-arm bend after impact"},"start_time":1.25,"end_time":2.07,"severity":55,"focus":{"anchor":"ulna_l","bones":["humerus_l","ulna_l","radius_l"],"label":"Lead arm"}}],"gemx":{"model":"GEM-X SOMA77 joints (fingers dropped)","names":["Hips","Spine1","Spine2","Chest","Neck1","Neck2","Head","HeadEnd","Jaw","LeftEye","RightEye","LeftShoulder","LeftArm","LeftForeArm","LeftHand","RightShoulder","RightArm","RightForeArm","RightHand","LeftLeg","LeftShin","LeftFoot","LeftToeBase","LeftToeEnd","RightLeg","RightShin","RightFoot","RightToeBase","RightToeEnd"],"parents":[-1,0,1,2,3,4,5,6,6,6,6,3,11,12,13,3,15,16,17,0,19,20,21,22,0,24,25,26,27],"frames":[[[-0.005,1.037,-0.011],[0.012,1.08,-0.015],[0.053,1.136,-0.018],[0.089,1.203,-0.026],[0.287,1.384,-0.031],[0.355,1.417,-0.028],[0.412,1.44,-0.023],[0.552,1.524,-0.011],[0.431,1.413,-0.02],[0.503,1.393,-0.046],[0.496,1.395,0.02],[0.29,1.319,-0.04],[0.308,1.299,-0.189],[0.238,1.036,-0.184],[0.232,0.789,-0.116],[0.289,1.321,-0.012],[0.283,1.305,0.139],[0.235,1.037,0.143],[0.259,0.787,0.088],[-0.001,0.957,-0.114],[0.048,0.549,-0.186],[-0.033,0.103,-0.242],[0.076,0.03,-0.268],[0.134,0.001,-0.278],[-0.001,0.976,0.103],[0.063,0.568,0.169],[-0.039,0.125,0.214],[0.08,0.063,0.227],[0.138,0.035,0.231]],[[-0.006,1.037,-0.01],[0.01,1.08,-0.014],[0.051,1.136,-0.018],[0.088,1.203,-0.025],[0.285,1.385,-0.032],[0.352,1.419,-0.03],[0.409,1.442,-0.025],[0.549,1.526,-0.013],[0.428,1.415,-0.022],[0.5,1.395,-0.047],[0.493,1.397,0.019],[0.